  "job_B9.2.7_20251003_115004": {
    "chunk_text": "Lucinius his swostor sunu, \u00fe\u00e6t nan \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he under\u00feiedde him selfum monege \u00feeoda \u00fee \u00e6r w\u00e6ron Romanum ungewilde. & het atimbran ane burg on Crecum, & het hie be him hatan Constantinopolim. He bebead \u00e6rest monna \u00fe\u00e6t mon cirican timbrede, & \u00fe\u00e6t mon beluce \u00e6lc diofolgieldhus. He gefor ymb XXXI wintra \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he rice h\u00e6fde, on anum tune neah Nicomedio \u00fe\u00e6re byrig. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & XCI, feng Constantius to \u00fe\u00e6m onwalde & he Constantius hit h\u00e6fde XXIIII wintra. Hie wurdon ealle \u00fea gebro\u00feor on \u00fe\u00e6m Arianiscan gedwolan. Constantinus & Constans wunnon him betweonum, o\u00fe Constantinus wear\u00f0 ofslagen. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Magnentius ofslog Constans, & feng him to \u00fe\u00e6m rice, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Galliam & Italiam. On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum Ilirice gesetton Ueteromonem \u00feone mon to hiora anwealde, to \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t hie Ac Constantinus hiene ben\u00e6mde \u00e6g\u00feer ge \u00fe\u00e6s onwaldes, ge \u00fe\u00e6re purpuran \u00fee he werede, ge \u00c6fter he gefeaht wi\u00f0 Magnentiuse, & hiene gefliemde, & bedraf into Luchina \u00fe\u00e6re byrig; & he \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Constantius gesette Iulianus to casere under him, se w\u00e6s \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6m to diacone \u00dea he \u00fe\u00e6t geacsade & him ongeanweard w\u00e6s, \u00fea he gefor on \u00fe\u00e6m f\u00e6relte. & Iulianus feng to \u00fe\u00e6m onwalde, & hiene h\u00e6fde an gear & eahta mona\u00f0. \u00dea w\u00e6",
